{"title":"회개불가 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dmCcp5/hAd4h0u4yl/7jUCKX1VbjUA7oiNY5lGe0&filename=th3","synopsis":"하나뿐인 여동생 도아에게 살갑지 못하지만 \n가난한 형편에도 도아만큼은 잘 돌보려고 노력하는 오빠 도혁. \n\n그러던 어느 날, 부유층 자제인 현수와 그의 패거리가 중학생 도아를 지속적으로 집단 강간해왔다는 충격적인 사실을 알게 된다. \n\n도혁은 조현수를 찾아가 혈투를 벌이다 함께 옥상에서 떨어지고 마는데, \n깨어나 보니 조현수의 몸이다. \n\n더 이상 삶의 희망이 없는 도혁에게 동생이 당한 것처럼, \n아니 그보다 더 고통스러운 날들을 그들에게 돌려주겠다는 목표만 남아있을 뿐이다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-02","rank":181,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-03","rank":239,"change":{"type":"down","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-11-04","rank":158,"change":{"type":"up","amount":81}},{"date":"2026-11-05","rank":227,"change":{"type":"down","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-11-06","rank":257,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":289,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":295,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-02","rank":258,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-03","rank":257,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-11-04","rank":258,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-11-05","rank":260,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-11-06","rank":260,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-07","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-11-08","rank":260,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-11-09","rank":275,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-11-10","rank":278,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-11-20","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-21","rank":297,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-22","rank":294,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-11-23","rank":290,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-11-24